", "content": "the main part of a structure  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The body of the statue was starting to break apart."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob06aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "million"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "1,000,000  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It seems like  over a million people visit this Sphinx every year."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob06aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to get closer"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to come very near an object "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Sally wanted to get closer to the Sphinx."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob06aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ramp"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a sloped surface that joins to uneven surfaces "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The ramp makes it easier for tourists to get into the buildings."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le11ob06aud05"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Look at some websites about Egypt."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find four points about the Great Sphinx. Write 6 - 8 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Locate two pictures of the Great Sphinx."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Say why you want to visit the Sphinx."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the statements to your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Show your partner the pictures of the Sphinx."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I research about the Sphinx."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can write 6 - 8 sentences."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I can sho